MOINEX bundles the following third-party assets:

Twemoji
-------
Location: src/main/resources/emoji/
Source: https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji
Copyright 2020 Twitter, Inc and other contributors
Licensed under CC-BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The full Twemoji SVG set is included (assets/svg from the upstream repository,
~4000 icons, ~19MB), used by the AI chat assistant to render emoji as images
since JavaFX WebView does not support color emoji font glyphs.
